# News source smoke requests.
# The direct feed call verifies the Google News RSS search feed is reachable (experimental source, personal/non-commercial feed).
# App calls verify PostForge source adapters, mapping, persistence, and metrics.
# Keep real API keys and access tokens in local IDE environment variables.

@appBaseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@adminAccessToken = paste-admin-access-token-here
@monitoringUsername = paste-configured-monitoring-username-here
@monitoringPassword = paste-configured-monitoring-password-here

# Monitoring variables must match MONITORING_USERNAME / MONITORING_PASSWORD.

### Direct Google News RSS search: verify the feed is reachable
GET https://news.google.com/rss/search?q=아이폰%20출시&hl=ko&gl=KR&ceid=KR:ko
Accept: application/rss+xml

### App manual news document collection: ADMIN, fetches Google News RSS and stores document chunks/embeddings
# Requires GOOGLE_NEWS_ENABLED=true.
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/api/admin/news-documents/manual
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "keyword": "아이폰 출시",
  "displayCount": 5,
  "topics": [
    "출시",
    "리뷰",
    "예약판매"
  ]
}

### App manual launch-news posting: ADMIN, may create PRODUCT_LAUNCH_NEWS posts
# Collects once, stores chunks/embeddings, then applies gates and RAG draft generation before posting.
# Requires the vector store and LLM as well as the news source. displayCount and dailyCap are separate.
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/api/admin/launch-news/manual
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "keyword": "아이폰 출시",
  "displayCount": 5,
  "dailyCap": 1,
  "category": "TECHNOLOGY",
  "topics": [
    "출시",
    "공식 발표"
  ]
}

### App news source metrics: verify external_news_fetch_* metrics
GET {{appBaseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus
Authorization: Basic {{monitoringUsername}} {{monitoringPassword}}

### Daily digest: summarizes previously published launch-news posts, without fetching the feed again
# Omitted newsDate uses yesterday in Asia/Seoul. This request may create DAILY_DIGEST posts.
# Scheduled digest runs at 06:00 Asia/Seoul when enabled; this manual request runs immediately.
POST {{appBaseUrl}}/api/admin/news/digest
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Offline regression checks (no real API credentials required)
# ./gradlew check -PexcludeTags=integration
# Explicit live check: ./gradlew :source:test -PgoogleNewsSmoke=true --tests '*GoogleNewsRssSmokeTest'
# Live smoke requires the explicit flag and network access; a skipped test is not a live API pass.
